Subject: [B.A.T.M.A.N.] [PATCH 2/3] batmand: Remove unmaintained batgat
	kernel module
Reply-To: The list for a Better Approach To Mobile Ad-hoc Networking
	<b.a.t.m.a.n@lists.open-mesh.org>
